                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="Start with Windows" Style="{StaticResource RowName}"/><local:HelpMark Style="{StaticResource HelpMark}" Margin="8,0,0,0" AutomationProperties.Name="More about Start with Windows" HelpText="Opens Hush when you sign in to Windows, quietly: minimized, or in the tray when Minimize to tray is on. It never starts in front of what you are doing. With administrator mode on, the installed copy starts without a permission prompt; a portable copy would ask Windows' permission at every sign-in, so install Hush if you want both."/></StackPanel>
